{
  "_doc": "Copy to .mcp.json (gitignored) ONLY if you need a per-project registration. Prefer registering cod-doc once per harness instead: `claude mcp add --transport http cod-doc http://127.0.0.1:8801/mcp -s user` for Claude Code, or the same block in ~/.cursor/mcp.json for Cursor. Duplicate registrations were what produced a doubled tool catalog (ADO-171).",

  "_daemon": "The URL below is served by a single always-on daemon, not a per-session subprocess. Install it with deploy/launchd/cod-doc-mcp-daemon.sh install — :8801 is the standard profile (121 tools), :8802 is the agent profile (6). The profile is chosen by port, not by a client flag.",

  "_project_is_required": "On the shared daemon every DB-backed tool needs an explicit `project` argument; there is no per-session default and set_default_project refuses. See cod_doc/mcp/tools/_workspace.py.",

  "mcpServers": {
    "cod-doc": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8801/mcp"
    }
  }
}
